# Code owners for Controlvar.
#
# Intent, not an enforced rule today: main's branch protection requires no review
# (scripts/configure-repo.sh writes none), so these owners are requested as
# reviewers but a pull request that touches those paths is not blocked on them. Order matters: the LAST matching pattern
# wins, so the SDK directory is listed last.
#
# Replace @amarkanday with the org team handle when the repository moves to its
# public org (see the naming decision in the launch plan).

# Default owner for everything not matched below.
*                           @amarkanday

# Licensing, security and community policy.
/LICENSE                    @amarkanday
/NOTICE                     @amarkanday
/THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md    @amarkanday
/SECURITY.md                @amarkanday
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md         @amarkanday
/CONTRIBUTING.md            @amarkanday
/.github/CODEOWNERS         @amarkanday
/.github/workflows/         @amarkanday

# Client SDKs: MIT licensed and bound by the cross-SDK hashing contract.
# A change here can fork assignment behaviour across sixteen packages.
/sdk/                       @amarkanday
